# XSH rewinddir()
# Copyright (c) 2026 Nicholas Martin. All rights reserved.

assertion  XSH.rewinddir.001
anchor     functions/rewinddir.html#DESCRIPTION
class      required
since      1988
says       After reading a stream of a, b and c to the end, rewinddir() makes
           readdir() return a, b and c again.
test       t/001-rewind.c

assertion  XSH.rewinddir.002
anchor     functions/rewinddir.html#DESCRIPTION
class      required
since      1988
says       With a stream of a, b and c read to the end, after file d is created
           and b removed, rewinddir() makes readdir() return a, c and d.
test       t/002-current-state.c
